    "key": "nurture-1",
    "file": "nurture-1.html",
    "name": "Nurture 1 of 3 (the problem)",
    "subject": "The most expensive number in your business",
    "useWhen": "Step 1 of the 3-part lead nurture sequence (name the problem).",
    "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n  <meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge\">\n  <meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light only\">\n  <meta name=\"supported-color-schemes\" content=\"light only\">\n  <title>The most expensive number in your business</title>\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background:#efeae0;\">\n  <div style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;color:transparent;\">It is the number of leads that reach out and never hear back in time.</div>\n  <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background:#efeae0;\">\n    <tr>\n      <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:32px 16px;\">\n        <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"600\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"width:600px;max-width:600px;\">\n          <tr>\n            <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:6px 0 26px;\">\n              <img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dnly2ngqc/image/upload/f_png,w_200/v1756916099/TMD2_logo_tbg_1200_bxzkc8.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"Tekmadev\" style=\"display:block;border:0;outline:none;text-decoration:none;width:64px;height:64px;\">\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #e7e1d5;border-radius:18px;padding:44px 44px 40px;\">\n              <p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#a17a4f;\">Nurture · 1 of 3</p>\n              <h1 style=\"margin:0 0 20px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:28px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.5px;line-height:1.2;color:#0d0c0a;\">Your leads are leaking. Here is where.</h1>\n              <p style=\"margin:0 0 24px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:18px;line-height:1.6;color:#2a2722;\">Hi {{contact.first_name}}, most service businesses do not have a lead problem. They have a follow-up problem.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 20px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.65;color:#5a564d;\">A prospect fills out your form or calls after hours. Five minutes pass, then an hour, then a day. By the time someone replies, they have already booked with whoever answered first. The lead was never bad. The response was just too slow.</p>\n\n              <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:0 0 20px;\">\n                <tr><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0 10px 12px 0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1;color:#a17a4f;\">&bull;</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0 0 12px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:#5a564d;\">The average business takes hours to respond. The winner responds in seconds.</td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0 10px 12px 0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1;color:#a17a4f;\">&bull;</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0 0 12px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:#5a564d;\">Half of buyers pick the company that replies first, not the cheapest.</td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0 10px 12px 0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1;color:#a17a4f;\">&bull;</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0 0 12px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:#5a564d;\">Every missed call after hours is a booked job for a competitor.</td></tr>\n              </table>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 20px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.65;color:#5a564d;\">This is the leak we plug first. Not more ads, not more leads. A system that catches every inquiry the moment it lands and works it until it books.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 20px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.65;color:#5a564d;\">Tomorrow, I will show you exactly how that system is built. For now, if you want to see where your own pipeline leaks, book a 45 minute audit and we will map it live.</p>\n\n              <table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:14px 0 6px;\">\n                <tr>\n                  <td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#a17a4f\" style=\"border-radius:999px;mso-padding-alt:15px 38px;\">\n                    <a href=\"https://www.tekmadev.com/api/e/c?c=nurture-1&l=nurture1-book&u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.tekmadev.com%2F%23book\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:#a17a4f;padding:15px 38px;mso-padding-alt:0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:999px;\">Book my pipeline audit</a>\n                  </td>\n                </tr>\n              </table>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"padding:26px 12px 8px;text-align:center;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.7;color:#8a857a;\">\n              <strong style=\"color:#5a564d;\">Tekmadev Innovation Inc.</strong><br>\n              40 Courtland Ave, Hamilton, Ontario L9B 1X6, Canada<br>\n              <a href=\"https://www.tekmadev.com\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#a17a4f;text-decoration:none;\">tekmadev.com</a>\n              &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp;\n              <a href=\"{{unsubscribe_link}}\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#8a857a;text-decoration:underline;\">Unsubscribe</a>\n              <br><br>\n              You're receiving this because you subscribed at tekmadev.com.\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n        </table>\n        <img src=\"https://www.tekmadev.com/api/e/o?c=nurture-1\" width=\"1\" height=\"1\" alt=\"\" style=\"display:block;width:1px;height:1px;border:0;overflow:hidden;\">\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n</body>\n</html>",
